 Kingdom Theme Deck","cleanName":"Portal Three Kingdoms Shu Kingdom Theme Deck","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/498730_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":88,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/498730/magic-portal-three-kingdoms-portal-three-kingdoms-shu-kingdom-theme-deck","modifiedOn":"2023-06-02T13:33:01.78","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Shu Kingdom is a well-balanced deck that features many of the famous heroes from the Three Kingdoms story. it has a good mix of creatues and sorceries, and the creatures are of varying costs.\r\nShu Kingdom has many creatures with horsemanship as well as sorceries to get rid of your opponent's creatures or pump up yours.\r\n<br>\r\nThis deck also features three of the famous heroes from the Three Kingdom's Story: Liu Bei, Zhang Fei and Guan Yu."}]},{"productId":498731,"name":"Portal Three Kingdoms - Wu Kingdom Theme Deck","cleanName":"Portal Three Kingdoms Wu Kingdom Theme Deck","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/498731_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":88,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/498731/magic-portal-three-kingdoms-portal-three-kingdoms-wu-kingdom-theme-deck","modifiedOn":"2023-06-02T13:33:52.687","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Like the kingdom for which it's named, Wu Kingdom is a subtle yet sometimes fierce deck. With it, your goal is to control the playing field.\r\nThe deck features seven creatures with horsemanship, more than any of the other Portal Three Kingdoms preconstructed decks. Because they can't be blocked by creatures without horsemanship, these creatures will be the way you finish off your opponent.\r\n<br>\r\nThe second way Wu Kingdom gains control is through counterspells. This deck features six sorceries that can counter one of your opponent's spells.\r\n<br>\r\nThis deck also contains the Legend Creatures Lu Xun, Scholar General and Sun Quan, Lord of Wu."}]},{"productId":498732,"name":"Portal Three Kingdoms - Wei Kingdom Theme Deck","cleanName":"Portal Three Kingdoms Wei Kingdom Theme Deck","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/498732_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":88,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/498732/magic-portal-three-kingdoms-portal-three-kingdoms-wei-kingdom-theme-deck","modifiedOn":"2023-06-02T13:34:38.597","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The path to victory with Wei Kingdom is the path of disruption.\r\nThe deck features six cards dedicated to destroying your opponent's creatures.\r\n<br>\r\nThe second way Wei Kingdom disrupts your opponent's game is through card denial. In the early part of the game, removing cards from your opponent's hand can prove vital to victory.\r\n<br>\r\nThis deck also features the Legendary Creatures Cao Cao, Lord of Wei and Sima Yi, Wei Field Marshal."}]}]}